{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"email-authentication-checker UI copy.fields.accuracyNote","detected_language":"sw","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"email-authentication-checker.copy.fields.accuracyNote","keys":["email-authentication-checker.copy.fields.accuracyNote"],"locale":"ha","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Lokacin da kake gudanar da binciken, mai warware DNS na Cloudflare na jama'a yana karɓar sunayen shafukan da aka tambaya da kuma adireshin IP na mai bincike. Kayan aikin ba ya aika imel, bincika abun cikin saƙo, tabbatar da mai aikawa na gaskiya ko adana sakamakon. Rikodin DNS na iya canzawa kuma amsoshin masu warwarewa na iya ajiyewa a cikin ajiya. Asusun bincike na SPF yana da ɓangare: wannan shafi ba ya yin nazari kan macros na mai aikawa ko kuma yana faɗaɗawa gabaɗaya a, mx, ptr da hanyoyin da ke akwai. Ya kamata a samar da masu zaɓa DKIM; wannan shafi ba ya gano su.","record_id":"3006971a7edb602107d37a5d5074a606c6976908c599ee90cf83ba86a99f9f3c","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40843674935","seconds":3.3050731883749904,"source":"When you run the check, Cloudflare’s public DNS resolver receives the queried domain names and your browser IP address. The tool does not send email, inspect message content, verify an actual sender or save the results. DNS records can change and resolver responses may be cached. SPF lookup accounting is partial: this page does not evaluate sender-specific macros or fully expand a, mx, ptr and exists mechanisms. DKIM selectors must be supplied; this page does not discover them.","source_commit":"e1f72394198c1a94fce448ea14cd79b496701273","source_hash":"d1e1fbbbc6b58091e51069311ebe23abcffa83080e3006a5bbc6ca7b38dc4b94","status":"needs-review","translation":"Lokacin da kake gudanar da binciken, mai warware DNS na Cloudflare na jama'a yana karɓar sunayen shafukan da aka tambaya da kuma adireshin IP na mai bincike. Kayan aikin ba ya aika imel, bincika abun cikin saƙo, tabbatar da mai aikawa na gaskiya ko adana sakamakon. Rikodin DNS na iya canzawa kuma amsoshin masu warwarewa na iya ajiyewa a cikin ajiya. Asusun bincike na SPF yana da ɓangare: wannan shafi ba ya yin nazari kan macros na mai aikawa ko kuma yana faɗaɗawa gabaɗaya a, mx, ptr da hanyoyin da ke akwai. Ya kamata a samar da masu zaɓa DKIM; wannan shafi ba ya gano su.","truncated":false,"warnings":["language_detection"]}
